# Keep SQL migrations byte-stable across platforms.
# `sqlx::migrate!` embeds the migration files at compile time and SQLx stores a
# SHA-384 checksum of each applied migration in `_sqlx_migrations`. A CRLF
# working copy changes those bytes, so an existing database fails to open with
# "migration N was previously applied but has been modified".
src-tauri/migrations/*.sql text eol=lf
